{"t":"Quara","s":"quara-c3717","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Quara_Constrictor_0de67a.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The Quara are aquatic creatures that inhabit the seafloor. They were slaves of the dark power that once ruled the ocean around the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shattered%20Isles\">Shattered Isles</a> and was annihilated by some disaster. Even though their primary home is underwater, the Quara Scouts have been known to make excursions on dry land and raids of the nearby human settlements. They can be found resting and exploring the <a href=\"#/wiki/Forbidden%20Islands\">Forbidden Islands</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Frozen%20Trench\">Frozen Trench</a>, but they prefer to stay underwater, where they are much stronger. Their scouts also swim sometimes to <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Raid\">raid</a> it. They also glow in the dark.\n</p><p>All Quara are weak to Energy Damage, And some quaras are weak to Earth Damage.\n<span id=\"w-Quaras\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Quaras\">Quaras</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Exp\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">HP\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Loot\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\"><img alt=\"Quara Constrictor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Constrictor_0de67a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\">Quara Constrictor</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">380\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">450\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-100× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Qu